{# Visible FAQ block for tool pages. Renders from the page's `faqs:`
   frontmatter — an array of { q, a } pairs — which is the SAME source
   head.njk feeds to the faqJsonLd filter for the FAQPage structured data,
   so the on-page copy and the schema can't drift (the site's
   one-source-two-consumers pattern, as with quiz banks).

       ---
       faqs:
           - q: What is valve authority?
             a: The share of a circuit's pressure drop the valve takes when
                wide open. Below ~0.25 the valve barely controls flow.
       ---
       {% from "faq.njk" import faqBlock %}
       ...
       {{ faqBlock(faqs) }}          {# default heading #}
       {{ faqBlock(faqs, "Cv FAQ") }} {# custom heading #}

   Questions render as <h3> (deliberate: the searched phrase lands in a
   heading — the on-page ranking lever); answers may carry inline HTML.
   Placement: inside <main>, near the end, above relatedLinks / .back-link.
   Styling in html/styles.css under "FAQ BLOCK". #}

{% macro faqBlock(faqs, heading) %}
    {% if faqs and faqs.length %}
    <section class="faq-block" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
        <h2 class="ps-section-label" id="faq-heading">{{ heading or "Common questions" }}</h2>
        {% for item in faqs %}
        <h3 class="faq-q">{{ item.q }}</h3>
        <div class="faq-a">{{ item.a | safe }}</div>
        {% endfor %}
    </section>
    {% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
